# Frontend Conventions

## Paths
- `@/*` → `app/`, `@shared/*` → `shared/` — prefer aliases over deep relatives

## Styling (see also `design.mdc` — always applied)
- Tailwind 3 + tokens from `app/global.css` / `tailwind.config.ts`
- **Visual contract**: `DESIGN.md` — evergreen + citron, Archivo, **pace radii (3px / 2px) platform-wide**
- **Never** arbitrary colors (`text-emerald-500`, `bg-amber-400`, etc.) except intentional brand hex already in pace CSS
- Use semantic tokens: `primary`, `accent`, `destructive`, `muted`, `secondary`, `foreground`, `background`, `border`, `card`, `input`, `ring`, `atleita-*`
- Prefer `app/components/ui/` (Radix + Tailwind) — defaults are already pace-shaped; do not override back to soft SaaS
- Reuse `.pace-*` classes for marketing/onboarding/auth; staff/portal shells use `.pace-site`
- Lucide icons first; **no emoji glyphs** in product UI or i18n
- **Mobile first** — see `mobile.mdc`; page shells must use `w-full max-w-full min-w-0 overflow-x-clip`; **no page-level horizontal scroll**
- Smooth, restrained motion; keep UX clean — no glassmorphism / multi-layer glow

## i18n
- Locale files: `app/i18n/locales/en.json` and `es.json`
- New UI strings → both locales + `t('key')` via `useTranslation()`

## Forms
- Formik + Yup; reusable schemas; submit via Redux thunks
- Public/onboarding forms: prefer `pace-form-field` / `pace-wizard-*` when in a pace shell

## Logging
- UI: `app/utils/logger.ts` only (not raw `console.*`)
